---
// 图 1：Codex CLI 两阶段异步记忆流水线（两个 6 小时门槛 + 三层存储）与独立的项目 Skill 通道。
const { lang = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const en = lang === 'en';
const T = {
  zh: {
    k0: 'Codex CLI 记忆与 Skill 架构：App Server 在有输入的新回合触发后台两阶段流水线，经过两个 6 小时窗口写入 memory_summary.md；项目 Skill 独立按工作目录加载',
    tAuto: '自动演示',
    tP1: '阶段一：单线程提取',
    tP2: '阶段二：全局整理',
    tRead: '新线程读取',
    c1: '旧线程 rollout',
    c1a: '空闲 ≥ 6 小时 · 10 天内',
    c1b: '排除触发扫描的当前线程',
    c2: 'stage1_outputs',
    c2a: 'SQLite 单线程证据行',
    c2b: '上限 9,000 B · 空结果删旧行',
    c3: '全局整理 · Phase 2',
    c3a: '冷却 ≥ 6 小时 · 至多 256 条',
    c3b: '同步 rollout_summaries/ + 写总摘要',
    c4: '新线程上下文',
    c4a: '读 memory_summary.md',
    c4b: '裁至 2,500 token · 按需查证据',
    a1: '8 MiB 分级取样',
    a2: 'Git 基线做差',
    a3: '读端宽松读取',
    skL: '项目 Skill 独立通道',
    skR: '沿 cwd 到项目根扫 .agents/skills → 清单进提示词 → 选用后读正文（与记忆冷却无关）',
    notes: {
      auto: '一条纠正要跨过两个 6 小时门槛与三层落盘（stage1_outputs → rollout_summaries/ → memory_summary.md）；项目 Skill 走独立路径，随工作目录立刻生效。',
      p1: '阶段一：新回合触发扫描，跳过当前线程，挑空闲 ≥ 6 小时的旧交互线程（每次最多 2 个），按 Human → Final → Tool 优先级取样提取；返回空会删除旧行，报错则保留旧行。',
      p2: '阶段二：距上次成功整理满 6 小时后才可再拿租约；同步最多 256 条来源文件并把 Git 差异交给整理 Agent；验收只查格式（v1 首行 + 4 个标题 + <10 KB），不核对具体事实。',
      read: '新线程读取：读端只要求非空可读文本（不复查 4 个标题），裁至 2,500 token 塞入提示词；若需确认细节，再按摘要指引去打开对应 rollout_summaries 文件。',
    },
    cap: '图 1\u3000Codex CLI 的两阶段后台记忆流水线与独立项目 Skill 路径。',
  },
  en: {
    k0: 'Codex CLI memory and skill flow: turn/start triggers a two-phase background pipeline gated by two 6-hour clocks to update memory_summary.md, while project skills follow cwd independently',
    tAuto: 'Auto',
    tP1: 'Phase 1: Extract',
    tP2: 'Phase 2: Consolidate',
    tRead: 'New thread reads',
    c1: 'Past rollout',
    c1a: 'idle ≥ 6h · within 10d',
    c1b: 'excludes triggering thread',
    c2: 'stage1_outputs',
    c2a: 'SQLite per-thread row',
    c2b: '9,000 B cap · empty retracts',
    c3: 'Phase 2 Consolidator',
    c3a: '6h cooldown · up to 256 rows',
    c3b: 'syncs files + memory_summary',
    c4: 'Future thread',
    c4a: 'reads memory_summary.md',
    c4b: '2,500-token cap · lazy details',
    a1: '8 MiB tiered',
    a2: 'Git diff',
    a3: 'permissive read',
    skL: 'Project skills (separate path)',
    skR: '.agents/skills from cwd to repo root → catalog → body on selection (independent of cooldowns)',
    notes: {
      auto: 'One correction crosses two 6-hour clocks and three persisted layers (stage1_outputs → rollout_summaries/ → memory_summary.md); project skills follow cwd immediately.',
      p1: 'Phase 1: turn/start claims up to 2 past interactive threads idle ≥ 6h, sampling Human → Final → Tool tiers; an empty result deletes prior rows while errors leave them standing.',
      p2: 'Phase 2: waits a second 6h cooldown after the last success, syncs up to 256 source files, diffs against Git, and validates only format (v1 + 4 headings + <10 KB)—never factual inclusion.',
      read: 'New thread read: accepts any non-empty readable summary (skipping the 4-heading check), trims to 2,500 tokens, and opens underlying rollout_summaries only when evidence is needed.',
    },
    cap: 'Figure 1. Codex CLI’s two-phase background memory pipeline and separate project-skill discovery path.',
  },
}[en ? 'en' : 'zh'];
---
<figure class="fig cx-arch" data-mode="auto" data-visible="1" lang={en ? 'en' : 'zh-CN'}>
  <div class="arch-bar" role="tablist" aria-label={en ? 'Pipeline stage' : '切换演示阶段'}>
    <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="arch-tab on" data-set="auto">{T.tAuto}</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="arch-tab" data-set="p1">{T.tP1}</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="arch-tab" data-set="p2">{T.tP2}</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="arch-tab" data-set="read">{T.tRead}</button>
  </div>

  <div class="fig-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 820 206" role="img" aria-label={T.k0}>
      <defs>
        <marker id={`cx-ah-${lang}`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="var(--mute)" />
        </marker>
        <marker id={`cx-ag-${lang}`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="var(--plat)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <g class="zone z-1" data-focus="p1">
        <rect x="10" y="14" width="166" height="110" rx="10" class="box b1" />
        <text x="22" y="40" class="h">{T.c1}</text>
        <text x="22" y="66" class="m">{T.c1a}</text>
        <text x="22" y="88" class="m">{T.c1b}</text>
      </g>

      <g class="zone z-2" data-focus="p1">
        <rect x="224" y="14" width="166" height="110" rx="10" class="box b2" />
        <text x="236" y="40" class="mo-h">{T.c2}</text>
        <text x="236" y="66" class="m">{T.c2a}</text>
        <text x="236" y="88" class="m">{T.c2b}</text>
      </g>

      <g class="zone z-3" data-focus="p2">
        <rect x="438" y="14" width="174" height="110" rx="10" class="box b3" />
        <text x="450" y="40" class="h">{T.c3}</text>
        <text x="450" y="66" class="m">{T.c3a}</text>
        <text x="450" y="88" class="m">{T.c3b}</text>
      </g>

      <g class="zone z-4" data-focus="read">
        <rect x="656" y="14" width="154" height="110" rx="10" class="box req b4" />
        <text x="668" y="40" class="h">{T.c4}</text>
        <text x="668" y="66" class="m">{T.c4a}</text>
        <text x="668" y="88" class="m">{T.c4b}</text>
      </g>

      <g class="ln">
        <path d="M176 69 H224" marker-end={`url(#cx-ah-${lang})`} class="l1" />
        <path d="M390 69 H438" marker-end={`url(#cx-ah-${lang})`} class="l2" />
        <path d="M612 69 H656" marker-end={`url(#cx-ag-${lang})`} class="gd l3" />
      </g>

      <g class="signals" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M176 69 H220" pathLength="1" class="sig s1" />
        <path d="M390 69 H434" pathLength="1" class="sig s2" />
        <path d="M612 69 H652" pathLength="1" class="sig s3" />
      </g>

      <g class="t" text-anchor="middle">
        <text x="200" y="57" class="s">{T.a1}</text>
        <text x="414" y="57" class="s">{T.a2}</text>
        <text x="634" y="57" class="g">{T.a3}</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Separate Skill track -->
      <rect x="10" y="146" width="800" height="46" rx="8" class="sk-box" />
      <text x="24" y="174" class="sk-l">{T.skL}</text>
      <text x={en ? 248 : 168} y="174" class="m">{T.skR}</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="arch-live" aria-live="polite">
    <p data-note="auto">{T.notes.auto}</p>
    <p data-note="p1">{T.notes.p1}</p>
    <p data-note="p2">{T.notes.p2}</p>
    <p data-note="read">{T.notes.read}</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption>{T.cap}</figcaption>
</figure>

<script is:inline>
  if (!window.__cxArchBound) {
    window.__cxArchBound = true;
    const init = () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('.cx-arch').forEach((fig) => {
        if (fig.dataset.inited) return;
        fig.dataset.inited = '1';
        let locked = 'auto';
        const setActive = (stage) => {
          fig.dataset.mode = stage;
          fig.querySelectorAll('.arch-tab').forEach((b) => {
            const on = b.dataset.set === stage;
            b.classList.toggle('on', on);
            b.setAttribute('aria-selected', on ? 'true' : 'false');
          });
        };
        fig.querySelectorAll('.arch-tab').forEach((btn) => {
          btn.addEventListener('click', () => { locked = btn.dataset.set; setActive(locked); });
        });
        fig.querySelectorAll('[data-focus]').forEach((zone) => {
          const target = zone.getAttribute('data-focus');
          zone.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => setActive(target));
          zone.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => setActive(locked));
          zone.addEventListener('click', () => { locked = locked === target ? 'auto' : target; setActive(locked); });
        });
        if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
          const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
            entries.forEach((e) => { fig.dataset.visible = e.isIntersecting ? '1' : '0'; });
          }, { threshold: 0.2 });
          io.observe(fig);
        }
      });
    };
    if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
    else init();
  }
</script>

<style>
  .cx-arch { margin: 1.8em 0; }
  .arch-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 22px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .arch-tab { position: relative; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 2px 9px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--mute); font: 400 13.5px/1.4 var(--sans); transition: color .18s ease; }
  .arch-tab::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: -1px; height: 2px; background: var(--plat); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: center; transition: transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1); }
  .arch-tab:hover { color: var(--fg-2); }
  .arch-tab.on { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 500; }
  .arch-tab.on::after { transform: scaleX(1); }

  .cx-arch svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .cx-arch .zone { cursor: pointer; transition: opacity .22s ease; }
  .cx-arch .box { fill: var(--card); stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; transition: stroke .22s, filter .22s; }
  .cx-arch .box.req { stroke: var(--plat); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .cx-arch .sk-box { fill: var(--code); stroke: var(--line); stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .cx-arch .zone:hover .box { stroke: var(--plat); }
  .cx-arch text { fill: var(--fg); font-family: var(--sans); pointer-events: none; }
  .cx-arch .h { font-weight: 600; font-size: 13.5px; }
  .cx-arch .mo-h { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .cx-arch .m { fill: var(--mute); font-size: 11px; }
  .cx-arch .s { fill: var(--mute); font-size: 10px; }
  .cx-arch .g { fill: var(--plat-ink); font-size: 10px; font-family: var(--mono); }
  .cx-arch .sk-l { font-weight: 600; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--fg-2); }
  .cx-arch .ln path { fill: none; stroke: var(--mute); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .cx-arch .ln .gd { stroke: var(--plat); stroke-width: 1.5; }

  .arch-live { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 2.5px solid var(--plat); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--card); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--fg-2); }
  .arch-live p { margin: 0 !important; display: none; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="auto"] .arch-live [data-note="auto"],
  .cx-arch[data-mode="p1"]   .arch-live [data-note="p1"],
  .cx-arch[data-mode="p2"]   .arch-live [data-note="p2"],
  .cx-arch[data-mode="read"] .arch-live [data-note="read"] { display: block; }
  .cx-arch figcaption { margin-top: 8px; }

  .cx-arch .sig { fill: none; stroke: var(--plat); stroke-width: 2.4; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-dasharray: 0.36 1; stroke-dashoffset: 0.38; opacity: 0; }

  .cx-arch[data-mode="auto"][data-visible="1"] .b1 { animation: cx-p 7.5s ease-in-out infinite 0s; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="auto"][data-visible="1"] .s1 { animation: cx-s 7.5s ease-in-out infinite 0s; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="auto"][data-visible="1"] .b2 { animation: cx-p 7.5s ease-in-out infinite 1.8s; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="auto"][data-visible="1"] .s2 { animation: cx-s 7.5s ease-in-out infinite 1.8s; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="auto"][data-visible="1"] .b3 { animation: cx-p 7.5s ease-in-out infinite 3.6s; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="auto"][data-visible="1"] .s3 { animation: cx-s 7.5s ease-in-out infinite 3.6s; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="auto"][data-visible="1"] .b4 { animation: cx-p 7.5s ease-in-out infinite 5.4s; }

  .cx-arch[data-mode="p1"] .z-3, .cx-arch[data-mode="p1"] .z-4 { opacity: 0.34; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="p1"] .b1, .cx-arch[data-mode="p1"] .b2 { stroke: var(--plat); stroke-width: 1.5; filter: drop-shadow(0 5px 14px var(--plat-soft)); }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="p1"] .s1 { animation: cx-run 1.2s linear infinite; }

  .cx-arch[data-mode="p2"] .z-1, .cx-arch[data-mode="p2"] .z-4 { opacity: 0.34; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="p2"] .b2, .cx-arch[data-mode="p2"] .b3 { stroke: var(--plat); stroke-width: 1.5; filter: drop-shadow(0 5px 14px var(--plat-soft)); }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="p2"] .s2 { animation: cx-run 1.2s linear infinite; }

  .cx-arch[data-mode="read"] .z-1, .cx-arch[data-mode="read"] .z-2 { opacity: 0.34; }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="read"] .b3, .cx-arch[data-mode="read"] .b4 { stroke: var(--plat); stroke-width: 1.5; filter: drop-shadow(0 5px 14px var(--plat-soft)); }
  .cx-arch[data-mode="read"] .s3 { animation: cx-run 1.2s linear infinite; }

  @keyframes cx-run { 0%{stroke-dashoffset:.38;opacity:0} 15%{opacity:1} 85%{opacity:1} 100%{stroke-dashoffset:-.8;opacity:0} }
  @keyframes cx-p   { 0%,30%,100%{stroke:var(--line);filter:none} 8%,22%{stroke:var(--plat);filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 12px var(--plat-soft))} }
  @keyframes cx-s   { 0%,6%{stroke-dashoffset:.38;opacity:0} 10%{opacity:1} 22%{stroke-dashoffset:-.76;opacity:1} 26%,100%{stroke-dashoffset:-.8;opacity:0} }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cx-arch svg * { animation: none !important; }
    .cx-arch .signals { display: none; }
  }
</style>
